    <tags>cantos hot-corners macos productivity tray windows admin</tags>
    <summary>macOS-style hot corners for Windows</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
Throw the cursor into a corner of the screen and something happens: Task View,
show desktop, lock, screensaver, display off, or any command you like.

A single 0.72 MB executable with no runtime dependencies, sitting in the tray
using about 2 MB and effectively no CPU.

* Configurable dwell delay, so overshooting toward a Close button does not
  trigger the corner.
* Suppressed automatically over fullscreen games and video.
* Multi-monitor aware, with outer-corners, per-screen, and primary-only modes.
* Optional modifier key requirement.
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/kidchenko/cantos/releases</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
